      "content": "Hey, I'm reviewing a ticket for a customer claiming a ceramic vase arrived shattered. They're demanding a full refund immediately. Given the need to keep costs down and avoid fraudulent refunds, how do you recommend we handle this? I want to make sure we aren't just handing out money for no reason, but we also don't want a massive dispute on our hands.",
